OL,3,GNEWSABond between care leavers and
OL,4,Aguardians celebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lifelong bond between young people
OL,7,Fin care and those who stand by them as
OL,8,Fthey move to independent adulthood has
OL,9,Fbeen celebrated with a special ceremony
OL,10,Ffor the first time.
OL,12,FSeven adult pairs attended the
OL,13,FGuardianship Ceremony at Northampton
OL,14,FSaints RFC's Franklin's Gardens stadium
OL,15,Fon Thursday.
OL,17,FAnj Begum was 17 and living in a
OL,18,Fchildren's home when she was matched
OL,19,Fwith Jess Holland eight years ago.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
